    "detailed_description": "Animal Connect Fusion is a delightful and engaging game with simple yet captivating gameplay. Players collect animals by connecting those located close together, forming the brightest straight line. The more animals connected, the higher the score.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSimple Gameplay: Connect animals of the same kind to score points.<br />\r\nPower Boosters: Create special boosters like Timer Extra, Bomb, and Rocket by connecting the necessary number of animals.<br />\r\nTimed Challenge: Players have 3 minutes to connect as many animals as possible and achieve the highest score.<br />\r\nColorful Graphics: Enjoy vibrant and cute animal graphics.<br />\r\nHigh Replay Value: Compete against yourself and others to beat high scores.<br />\r\nEnjoy the fun and challenge of Animal Connect Fusion, where every connection brings a new surprise!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMusic: The Cutest Bunny by Shane Ivers<br />\r\nLicensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License<br />\r\nhttps://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/<br />\r\nMusic promoted by https://www.chosic.com/free-music/all/",
